# =============================================================================
# Komodo Flutter Wallet — .gitignore
#
# This repo vendors the full Komodo SDK monorepo and the KDF Rust source under
# `sdk/`, so these rules must not be so broad that they exclude vendored
# source, nor so narrow that native build artifacts (several GB) get committed.
#
# heavies at a glance (all regenerable — see README.md):
#   build/                                   ~4 GB   flutter/xcode output
#   sdk/komodo-defi-framework/target/        ~720 MB cargo artifacts
#   sdk/dart-sdk/                            ~625 MB vendored Dart SDK (unused)
#   sdk/.../komodo_defi_framework/**/bin|libs  ~1 GB  prebuilt libkdf binaries
#   .dart_tool/                              ~330 MB pub resolution
#   web/kdf/                                 ~34 MB  KDF wasm for the web target
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor cruft
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.history/
.atom/
.svn/
.buildlog/

# IntelliJ / Android Studio
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.idea/

# VS Code contains launch config some teams track; this fork ignores it.
.vscode/
.vs/

# AI coding assistants (keep .kiro from the original file; add the common ones)
.kiro/
.claude/
.cursor/
.windsurf/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Flutter / Dart / Pub
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.packages
.pub-cache/
.pub/
**/doc/api/
**/build/
coverage/
*.lcov
**/devtools_options.yaml

# Generated plugin registrants and ephemeral Xcode config (regenerated by
# `flutter pub get` / `flutter build`). The hand-written Flutter-Debug.xcconfig
# and Flutter-Release.xcconfig ARE tracked.
**/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.*
**/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/Flutter/generated_plugin_registrant.dart
**/Flutter/generated_plugins.cmake

# Symbolication / obfuscation output
app.*.symbols
app.*.map.json

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CocoaPods (macos runner)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Pods are reproducible from Podfile + Podfile.lock; only the lockfile is
# tracked.
**/Pods/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Prebuilt KDF native binaries
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The komodo_wallet_build_transformer downloads (or compiles) `libkdf` for each
# platform and stamps the download with a hidden `.api_last_updated_*` marker.
# These are artifacts, not source — the Dart plugin glue, podspecs, gradle
# files, and C++ headers around them are tracked.

# Dart-side framework package (vendored under sdk/)
sdk/komodo-defi-sdk/packages/komodo_defi_framework/bin/
sdk/komodo-defi-sdk/packages/komodo_defi_framework/macos/bin/
sdk/komodo-defi-sdk/packages/komodo_defi_framework/linux/bin/
sdk/komodo-defi-sdk/packages/komodo_defi_framework/windows/bin/
sdk/komodo-defi-sdk/packages/komodo_defi_framework/ios/libkdf.a
sdk/komodo-defi-sdk/packages/komodo_defi_framework/android/app/src/main/cpp/libs/

# KDF Rust workspace (mm2 source is tracked; cargo output is not)
sdk/komodo-defi-framework/target/

# Vendored Dart SDK toolchain — unreferenced by the build (see README.md).
# Consider deleting it locally as well.
sdk/dart-sdk/

# Download cache stamps for the binaries above
**/.api_last_updated*

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Web target
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# KDF wasm/js for the web runner is downloaded by the build transformer
# (stamped with .api_last_updated_web). The hand-written glue in web/kdf/res/
# (kdf_wrapper.dart, bootstrapper) IS tracked. The old file also ignored
# web/index.html and web/src/* — those paths no longer exist in this fork;
# if/when the web runner is set up, review what should be tracked.
web/kdf/kdf/bin/
node_modules/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Firebase
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.firebase/
**/config/firebase_analytics.json

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local artifacts & secrets
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Release bundles
dist/
*.dmg
demo_link
airdex-build.tar.gz

# Local test/demo data that must never be committed
**/test_wallet.json
**/debug_data.json
contrib/coins_config.json

# Upstream leftovers
AGENTS_1.md
venv/
.fvm/
